      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 5.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "let me think, hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.43,
      "end_seconds": 10.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.85,
      "end_seconds": 18.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "I'm here cos of a sore on the bottom of my foot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.9,
      "end_seconds": 21.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.83,
      "end_seconds": 23.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "About... well, one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.0,
      "end_seconds": 27.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.73,
      "end_seconds": 35.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "A five out of ten, I suppose. I've also been feeling feverish, for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.48,
      "end_seconds": 39.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.23,
      "end_seconds": 52.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.01,
      "end_seconds": 77.3,
      "duration_seconds": 14.29,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 105 over 72, saturation 98 percent, height 156 centimetres, BMI works out to 36.6, temp 38.7 degrees, pulse is 100 beats a minute, weight 89 kilos, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.21,
      "end_seconds": 82.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.03,
      "end_seconds": 85.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.53,
      "end_seconds": 100.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "The pulses at the ankle are weak but I can feel them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.96,
      "end_seconds": 103.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.47,
      "end_seconds": 117.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "There is a two-centimetre ulcer on the ball of the right foot with redness around it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.54,
      "end_seconds": 123.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.53,
      "end_seconds": 138.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Have you had any chest pain or calf pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.54,
      "end_seconds": 144.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "I haven't had chest pain or calf pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.15,
      "end_seconds": 149.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Have you had any confusion or black toes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.78,
      "end_seconds": 155.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "I haven't had confusion or black toes, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.65,
      "end_seconds": 159.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Right, is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.81,
      "end_seconds": 161.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "no problems with breathing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.81,
      "end_seconds": 180.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.8,
      "end_seconds": 188.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "I'm on gliclazide, 80 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.02,
      "end_seconds": 193.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.86,
      "end_seconds": 202.49,
      "duration_seconds": 7.63,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for five years now. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.26,
      "end_seconds": 211.65,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "mm, okay yes, diabetes is known to us, good to have that clear do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.25,
      "end_seconds": 216.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.2,
      "end_seconds": 220.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.95,
      "end_seconds": 224.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.09,
      "end_seconds": 228.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.19,
      "end_seconds": 233.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.81,
      "end_seconds": 237.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.06,
      "end_seconds": 241.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "I'm allergic to wheat, I get bloating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.93,
      "end_seconds": 256.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.38,
      "end_seconds": 261.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.53,
      "end_seconds": 288.81,
      "duration_seconds": 10.28,
      "text": "Putting it all together, my working impression is an infected diabetic foot ulcer. I think a foot X-ray makes sense here, for ulcer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.34,
      "end_seconds": 292.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Do I need to prepare?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.18,
      "end_seconds": 317.26,
      "duration_seconds": 23.08,
      "text": "I think a swab from the ulcer makes sense here, for infected ulcer we'll begin with amoxicillin/clavulanic acid, 625 milligrams, three times a day, for seven days that's for foot infection i'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.2,
      "end_seconds": 322.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "can I collect it from my own pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.98,
      "end_seconds": 338.02,
      "duration_seconds": 14.04,
      "text": "Keep the weight off that foot and keep the dressing dry. If the redness spreads or you feel unwell with a fever, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.83,
      "end_seconds": 340.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "That's fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.88,
      "end_seconds": 347.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "please come and see me after the swab result. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.14,
      "end_seconds": 352.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
